{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "slug": "voice-profile-demo-pocket",
  "cues": [
    {
      "start": 0.25,
      "end": 4.41,
      "text": "In Lagos, two software developers kept hearing the same complaint from small businesses."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.112,
      "end": 6.932,
      "text": "Taking payments online was slow,"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.212,
      "end": 10.032,
      "text": "expensive, and built for companies much larger than theirs."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.698,
      "end": 12.858,
      "text": "So they built a simpler checkout."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.318,
      "end": 15.098,
      "text": "One integration, one dashboard,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.398,
      "end": 17.418,
      "text": "and money that arrived where it was needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.038,
      "end": 19.218,
      "text": "The market was crowded."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.798,
      "end": 20.778,
      "text": "Trust was scarce."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.198,
      "end": 23.738,
      "text": "And every merchant wanted proof before switching."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.396,
      "end": 25.436,
      "text": "Then the numbers moved."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.136,
      "end": 27.956,
      "text": "Developers adopted it, investors noticed,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.456,
      "end": 32.256,
      "text": "and in 2020 Stripe acquired Paystack for about two hundred million dollars."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.243,
      "end": 35.723,
      "text": "The lesson is not that payments are glamorous."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.123,
      "end": 36.843,
      "text": "It is that a clear,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.903,
      "end": 39.903,
      "text": "useful tool can travel farther than a loud idea."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.55,
      "end": 44.57,
      "text": "Small problems, solved properly, can build something the whole world uses."
    }
  ]
}
